   "steps_unavailable": "The record states in its own formation that there is NO single rule: 他動詞/自動詞 are lexical PAIRS (開ける/開く, 閉める/閉まる, 出す/出る) that must be memorised, not a derivation one can run on an arbitrary verb. Encoding the cited 〜える/〜く tendency as steps would license *書ける as 'transitive 書く', which is in fact the potential — precisely the false-formation defect this field must avoid. No steps are emitted."
  },
